UID:2026-10-31-international-mindedness-festival@enishi.ac.jp
DTSTAMP:20261008T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Tokyo:20261031T100000
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Tokyo:20261031T140000
SUMMARY:International Mindedness Festival
DESCRIPTION:This year’s theme is “Festivals and Holidays Around the W
 orld”. A Saturday family event celebrating traditions\, cultures\, sto
 ries\, arts\, music and celebrations from around the world\, with studen
 t activities\, cultural displays\, performances\, arts and crafts\, and 
 interactive booths. Clean-up runs from 14:00 to 15:00\, and community me
 mbers are welcome to help. ELC and Primary students must attend with a p
 arent or guardian and may not be dropped off. School buses will not oper
 ate. More details will be shared soon.\n\nFor: Whole School (parents inv
 ited)\nhttps://enishi.ac.jp/EISCompass.html#/event/2026-10-31-internatio
 nal-mindedness-festival
URL:https://enishi.ac.jp/EISCompass.html#/event/2026-10-31-international-
 mindedness-festival
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
